      "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2042, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "* Direct replication over the Secrets API (TLS). No S3, no CRR, no KMS envelope.\n* Active-passive: no compute on the passive workspace; it only receives control-plane API writes.\n* Idempotent diff-and-apply: only changed secrets are written; a re-run is a no-op.\n* Direction is parameterized -> failover / failback is the same code with the roles swapped.\n* Secrets encrypted at rest by the platform in both workspaces; no independent offsite backup.",
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* Direct replication over the Secrets API (TLS). No S3, no CRR, no KMS envelope.\n* Active-passive: no compute on the passive workspace; it only receives control-plane API writes.\n* Idempotent diff-and-apply: only changed secrets are written; a re-run is a no-op.\n* Direction is parameterized -> failover / failback is the same code with the roles swapped.\n* Secrets encrypted at rest by the platform in both workspaces; no independent offsite backup.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 11, "autoResize": false }
  ],
